### For Commercial Use

If your intended use does not comply with AGPL-3.0 or is commercial in nature,
you MUST obtain a separate commercial license from AIDEN AGENT PTE. LTD.

### What Requires a Commercial License:

- Manufacturing and selling devices with this firmware
- Offering this software as a hosted service (SaaS)
- Bundling this software with commercial products
- Using this software internally in a for-profit organization
- Keeping modified versions proprietary or closed-source instead of complying
  with AGPL-3.0 source-disclosure obligations
- Any use that generates revenue or provides competitive advantage

AGPL-3.0 copyleft obligations apply to AGPL-licensed use regardless of whether
the use is commercial or non-commercial. A commercial license is required when
you want proprietary rights or terms that remove those copyleft obligations.

### Commercial License Benefits:

- Freedom to use in proprietary products
- No requirement to open-source modifications
- No copyleft obligations
- Dedicated technical support options
- Custom licensing terms available
- Patent grant for commercial use

### How to Obtain a Commercial License:

Contact us for pricing and terms:
- Email: contact@aidenai.io
