## Contributions

### Contributor License Agreement (CLA)

By submitting a contribution (pull request, patch, code, documentation, or any
other material) to this project, you agree that:

1. **License Grant**: You grant AIDEN AGENT PTE. LTD. and all users a perpetual, worldwide,
   non-exclusive, royalty-free license to your contribution under both AGPL-3.0
   and our commercial license terms.

2. **Patent Grant**: You grant a patent license for any patents you own or
   control that cover your contribution, under the same terms as above.

3. **Original Work**: Your contribution is your original work, and you have the
   right to grant these licenses.

4. **Dual Licensing Rights**: You acknowledge that AIDEN AGENT PTE. LTD. may license your
   contribution under commercial terms to third parties.

### Why We Need This

The dual-license model requires that we can offer commercial licenses for all
code in the project, including community contributions. Your CLA makes this
possible while ensuring your work remains open-source under AGPL-3.0.

